      "body": "## Motivation\n\nFixes #42139. Hunyuan streaming tool calls containing control characters such as `\\^_` emit invalid JSON and can corrupt subsequent argument deltas.\n\n## Modifications\n\nUse the same JSON string escaping for partial values as for completed arguments. Add regression coverage for all 32 control characters, quotes, backslashes and Unicode across single-character, seven-character and whole-response chunks.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nRebased onto `9fa9308e95`, which contains the required base `ff8d964cf5`. On this source, 45 Hunyuan tests and 105 subtests pass on CPU; the control-character streaming subcases fail with the unmodified main production code.\n\n`pre-commit run --all-files` passes, including the Rust formatting and Clippy checks.\n\nThese are feature-specific CPU serialization tests; model-forward and kernel code are unchanged.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNo model execution or kernel changes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] `pre-commit run --all-files` passes, including the Rust hooks.\n- [x] Add focused regression coverage to the registered CPU test suite.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n- [ ] Documentation update — not applicable.\n- [ ] Model accuracy and speed benchmarks — not applicable to this parser-only change.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38668202072](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38668202072)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38668202119](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38668202119)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38668202040](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38668202040)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
