      "body": "Rebased this fix onto `9fa9308e95` in `bb8de90181`; the branch now includes the required `MIN_BASE_SHA`. I reran 45 Hunyuan tests and 105 subtests on CPU and confirmed the control-character streaming subcases fail with current main's production code. The complete `pre-commit run --all-files` check also passes, including Rust formatting and Clippy.\n\nThe functional patch is unchanged by the rebase. Could a maintainer authorize baseline CI for this head with `/tag-and-rerun-ci` and complete the code-owner review?",
